text(local) RustboroCity_House2_Text_TrainerSchoolExcellent {
	"The Trainer's School is excellent.\p"
	"If you study there, you could even\n"
	"become a Gym Leader."
}

text(local) RustboroCity_House2_Text_RoxanneKnowsALot {
	"Roxanne, the Gym Leader, really knows\n"
	"a lot about Pok\emon.\p"
	"She's really strong, too!"
}

